# JX3 Unbounded - QX update/login routing V1.2
# Based on Kelee Loon SeasunJX3_remove_ads.plugin [General] real-ip
# IMPORTANT: DIRECT alone is not equivalent to Loon real-ip.
# Add *.xoyocdn.com and xg-flow.xoyo.com to [general] dns_exclusion_list,
# retaining all other existing exclusions. Details: JX3/README.md

host-wildcard,*-update.xoyocdn.com,direct
host,xg-flow.xoyo.com,direct
